{
  "slug": "boltz",
  "name": "Boltz",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Predict structures, screen molecules and proteins, and design binders with Boltz from Claude Code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `boltz-check-status` (Boltz job status and result recovery), `boltz-cli-setup` (Boltz CLI setup, auth, and runtime notes), `boltz-protein-design` (Design new protein binders with Boltz), `boltz-protein-screen` (Screen existing protein binders with Boltz), `boltz-small-molecule-adme` (Predict Tier-1 ADME/ADMET for small molecules with Boltz from bare SMILES — no target, no docking), `boltz-small-molecule-design` (Design new small-molecule binders with Boltz), `boltz-small-molecule-screen` (Screen existing small-molecule libraries with Boltz), `boltz-structure-and-binding` (Predict structures and binding for one defined complex with Boltz)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install boltz@claude-plugins-official` from `boltz-bio/boltz-api-skills` (`plugins/boltz`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
